      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I haven't even been able to come and see the baby!... Amma said that only tomorrow, after telling the zamindar... we should go see the baby!... How is the baby?... Does it have your mischief?... Does it look like Uma?... Fair?... Dark?...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
